<title>USA: NexUS Healthcare, Cemax-ICON Inc IPOs postponed.</title>
<headline>NexUS Healthcare, Cemax-ICON Inc IPOs postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lead underwriter Volpe, Welty &amp; Co said the proposed initial public offerings of Cemax-ICON and NexUS Healthcare have been postponed.</p>
<p>The underwriter did not give a reason for the postponements. No furhter information was immediately available.</p>
</text>
